guide forever/reputation/stormwind
title Stormwind Reputation
category Reputation
folder Reputation · Cities
faction Alliance
levels 12-60
zone Stormwind City
keywords Stormwind, Clavicus Knavingham, cloth quartermaster, Additional Runecloth, Wool, Silk, Mageweave, Runecloth, horse, Swift Palomino, grey quests, Northshire, Goldshire, Stockade, Chillwind Camp, Scourge Cauldrons, The True Masters
reward text Exalted with Stormwind: in Classic, other races may buy the horses
reward text About 1,150 Stormwind reputation from level 52-58 quests at Chillwind Camp and in the Burning Steppes
reward text About 4,500 Stormwind reputation from low-level quests in Elwynn and the Stockade (in Classic, a fifth of it at 60)
why Cloth, the Western Plaguelands' cauldron quests and the Elwynn hubs: the quests pay most while you level.

# Built from Forever's quest data (the reputation each quest pays, as Forever's
# quest pages give it), quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (givers, drops,
# farm spots), and the Forever client tables (Faction: Humans start at 4000,
# the other Alliance races at 3100; ItemSparse: no item needs Stormwind
# standing, and the horses carry no reputation requirement in the client).
# Numbers: the first donation of each cloth pays 150 (60 cloth); Additional
# Runecloth (7796) pays 50 for 20 Runecloth and repeats. Bands from Forever's
# steps: Friendly 6000, Honored 12000, Revered 21000.
# Low-level quests: in Classic a quest 6+ levels below you pays a fifth less per
# level, down to a fifth; one Forever beta report saw full pay at level 30.
# The quest hubs below are optional: each hub's first step carries a label,
# the steps after it run only when it was done (`when done`), so skipping the
# first step skips the hub.
# Level 52-58 quests first (they pay in full at 60, or nearly): Chillwind
# Camp's cauldron chain (5092-5226, 5097: 820, and 600 Argent Dawn), Janice
# Felstone's parcel (5021-5048: 150) and The True Masters up to Stormwind
# Keep (4182-4186: 175, and 175 Darnassus). Left to a tip: the Blackrock
# Depths chain of Marshal Windsor and The Great Masquerade (4241-6403: 750),
# Maxwell's Mission (5002, 5081: 250), Delivery to Ridgewell (135), The Key
# to Scholomance (200), Order Must Be Restored (Nathanos, 200), Onyxia's
# head (400) and Nefarian's (200 to every Alliance city), Commendation
# Signets (only from the Ahn'Qiraj war effort). Alterac Valley's Brotherly
# Love pays 100.
# ASSUMED: other races buy the horses at Exalted with Stormwind (Classic flow;
# Forever's data has no vendor rule for it). In-game check: Katie Hunter's
# stock for a non-Human at Exalted and below.
# INGAME: grey-quest rep at 60 (Classic: a fifth from 9 levels below; one Forever beta report: full, quest 456 at level 30 paid 100)
# INGAME: reputation discount (Classic: 10% at Honored with the vendor's faction; Forever guide sites report 5% at Friendly rising to 20% at Exalted, another says unannounced). Check a city vendor's price at Friendly and at Honored.
# Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain; the numbers here leave it out.
# No race has a reputation bonus in Forever (Diplomacy is gone).

step Clavicus Knavingham, the cloth quartermaster
  tip Clavicus Knavingham takes cloth for Stormwind. The arrow leads to him; he stands upstairs inside his building. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and Runecloth pays 150 reputation once; after the Runecloth one, Additional Runecloth pays 50 for every 20 Runecloth, as often as you like. The Auction House is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do Elwynn (levels 1-10), Westfall (10-18), Redridge (15-25) and Duskwood (20-30) while you level through them. After the donations come the level 52-58 quests of the Western Plaguelands and the Burning Steppes (about 1,150), then the optional low-level hubs, best rate first: Northshire and the city errands (about 40 a minute at full value), the Stockade (30), Eastvale and Goldshire (25). Every Stormwind gain also gives a quarter as much to Ironforge, Darnassus and the Gnomeregan Exiles, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain.
  level 12
  collect 2592 x60 nearest            -- Wool Cloth: Defias, gnolls and kobolds in Westfall and Redridge
  accept 7791
  turnin 7791

step A Donation of Silk
  tip Silk Cloth drops from humanoids level 23 to 40: Syndicate in Alterac and Arathi, the Defias of Duskwood's Raven Hill, Stranglethorn's trolls.
