  collect 4306 x60 nearest
  accept 7793
  turnin 7793

step A Donation of Mageweave
  tip Mageweave Cloth drops from humanoids level 35 to 50: the Dunemaul ogres of Tanaris, the Hatecrest naga of Feralas, the Shadowforge dwarves of the Badlands.
  level 40
  collect 4338 x60 nearest
  accept 7794
  turnin 7794

step A Donation of Runecloth
  tip Runecloth drops from humanoids level 50 and up: the Scourge cultists and Scarlet Crusade in the Plaguelands, the Deadwood furbolgs of Felwood, the Winterfall furbolgs of Winterspring. Keep any Runecloth past the first 60: it all goes to Additional Runecloth later.
  level 50
  collect 14047 x60 nearest
  accept 7795
  turnin 7795

step Chillwind Camp: Clear the Way
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip These quests are level 52 to 58, so they pay in full at 60, or nearly. Commander Ashlam Valorfist and High Priestess MacDonnell at Chillwind Camp, in the south of the Western Plaguelands, send you against the four Scourge cauldrons: 820 Stormwind reputation in all and 600 Argent Dawn on the side (in Classic about 690 Stormwind at 60, as the first quests are level 52 and 53). The Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls roam the fields north of the camp.
  level 55
  accept 5092                         -- Clear the Way, +100
  kill 1783 x10 quest 5092.1          -- Skeletal Flayer
  kill 1791 x10 quest 5092.2          -- Slavering Ghoul
  turnin 5092
  accept 5097                         -- All Along the Watchtowers, +100
  accept 5215                         -- The Scourge Cauldrons, +10
  turnin 5215                         -- High Priestess MacDonnell
  accept 5216                         -- Target: Felstone Field, +100

step Andorhal and Felstone Field
  tip Mark the four watchtowers around Andorhal, north of the camp, with the Beacon Torch at each door. Cauldron Lord Bilemaw guards the cauldron at Felstone Field, west of Andorhal; his key opens it. Janice Felstone's ghost wanders by the Felstone farmhouse, and her parcel lies inside: it goes to Stormwind for 150 more.
