  tip Helendis Riverhorn at Morgan's Vigil, in the south-east of the Burning Steppes, starts The True Masters: a chain to Lakeshire and Stormwind Keep, 175 Stormwind and 175 Darnassus reputation (level 54: in Classic four fifths of it at 60). The Black Broodlings and the Black Drake live on the slopes north of the Vigil; the Black Dragonspawn and Black Wyrmkin west of it, in the middle of the zone.
