step Lakeshire: Solomon again
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip With a group the chain goes on into Blackrock Depths: Marshal Windsor, Jail Break! and The Great Masquerade back in Stormwind pay about 750 Stormwind more, Maxwell's Mission (Lower Blackrock Spire) 250, Delivery to Ridgewell 135. Order Must Be Restored (Nathanos Blightcaller in the Eastern Plaguelands) pays 200, The Key to Scholomance 200; Onyxia's head 400 and Nefarian's 200 when the raids open.
  turnin 4186                         -- Magistrate Solomon

