step The Stockade: two quests
  label sw-stockade
  tip Optional: the Stockade is Stormwind's prison, a dungeon in the canals of the Mage Quarter. At 60 you clear it alone in ten minutes: 300 reputation (60 at a fifth). Warden Thelwater stands at the gate, Nikova Raskol in Old Town. Two more Stockade quests start outside the city, 100 each, if you pass by: What Comes Around... (Targorr the Dread) from Guard Berton in Lakeshire and Crime and Punishment (Dextren Ward) from Councilman Millstipe in Darkshire. (The Stockade Riots, 100 more, needs the Unsent Letter from Edwin VanCleef in the Deadmines first.) In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Skip this step to skip the hub.
  accept 387
  accept 388

