step Additional Runecloth to Honored
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Additional Runecloth: 50 reputation for 20 Runecloth, as often as you like. After the four first donations a non-Human stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 Runecloth (Humans start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; a Skyborne's Exploring the Alliance paid 100, two fewer). The level 52-58 quests above take 23 turn-ins off; every Elwynn hub you did takes 20 to 30 more off if it paid in full. More quest hubs pay Stormwind, in full while they are no more than 5 levels below you: Westfall (about 2,500 in all), Redridge's Lakeshire (about 3,000) and Duskwood's Darkshire (about 2,900). Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your Runecloth at once.
  collect 14047 x20 optional nearest
  turnin 7796 direct optional
  rep 72 Honored

step Additional Runecloth to Revered
  tip Honored: in Classic Stormwind's vendors take 10% off for you, Katie Hunter's horses (20g, the swift ones 200g) included; Forever has not settled it, and guide sites report 5% at Friendly rising to 20% at Exalted. Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation: 240 turn-ins, 4,800 Runecloth.
  collect 14047 x20 optional nearest
  turnin 7796 direct optional
  rep 72 Revered

step Additional Runecloth to Exalted
  tip Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 420 turn-ins, 8,400 Runecloth. At Exalted, Katie Hunter at Eastvale Logging Camp sells her horses to other races in Classic; the Horse and Swift Horse guides cover them.
  collect 14047 x20 optional nearest
  turnin 7796 direct optional
  rep 72 Exalted
